{"type": "answer", "run_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z", "scenario": "overload_naive_retry", "source": "stand-in", "setting": "large", "setting_def": {"piece_chars": 2400, "k": 3, "rerank": false, "router": true}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "qid": "Q3", "request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0008", "start_time": "2026-11-10T18:32:04.521+00:00", "arrival_offset_s": 23.207, "patience_s": 13.61, "gave_up": false, "waited_ms": 8403.2, "degraded": true, "reply": {"request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0008", "question": "How are the positional encodings built, and why sinusoids rather than learned embeddings?", "kind": "passages", "level": 3, "text": "No written answer this time: here are the most relevant passages from the papers, quoted as they are. A written answer should be possible in about 1 s.\n[S1] 1706.03762v7 p.6 §3.5: \"To this end, we add \"positional encodings\" to the input embeddings at the bottoms of the encoder and decoder stacks. The positional encodings have the same dimension d_model as the embeddings, so that the two can be summed. There are many choices of positional encodings, learned and fixed [9]. In this work, we use sine and cosine functions of different frequencies: P E_(pos,2i) = sin(pos/10000^2i/d_model) P E_(pos,2i+1) = cos(pos/10000^2i/d_model) where pos is the position and i is the dimension. That is, each dimension of the positional encoding corresponds to a sinusoid.\"\n[S2] 1706.03762v7 pp.8-9 §6.2: \"In Table 3 rows (B), we observe that reducing the attention key size d_k hurts model quality. This suggests that determining compatibility is not easy and that a more sophisticated compatibility function than dot product may be beneficial. We further observe in rows (C) and (D) that, as expected, bigger models are better, and dropout is very helpful in avoiding over-fitting. In row (E) we replace our sinusoidal positional encoding with learned positional embeddings [9], and observe nearly identical results to the base model.\"", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "cite": "1706.03762v7 p.6 §3.5", "pid": "attention:2400:0011", "paper": "attention", "block_ids": ["attention-p06-b004", "attention-p06-b005", "attention-p06-b006", "attention-p06-b007", "attention-p06-b008", "attention-p06-b009"]}, {"sid": "S2", "cite": "1706.03762v7 pp.8-9 §6.2", "pid": "attention:2400:0020", "paper": "attention", "block_ids": ["attention-p08-b012", "attention-p08-b013", "attention-p09-b001", "attention-p09-b002", "attention-p09-b003", "attention-p09-b004", "attention-p09-b005"]}], "notice": "passages only, no model call: no drafter available (openai/gpt-oss-120b: 429 rate_limited)", "eta_s": 0.0, "model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 200, "outcome": "ok", "prompt_tokens": 239, "completion_tokens": 56}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}], "spans": [{"name": "plan", "start_ms": 0.0, "end_ms": 0.4, "model": null, "outcome": "full", "detail": {"predicted_wait_s": {"full": {"openai/gpt-oss-120b": 0.0}}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}}, {"name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 2360.6, "model": null, "outcome": "router", "detail": {}}, {"name": "wait:understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 0.5, "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 2360.6, "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "outcome": "200:ok", "detail": {}}, {"name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 2360.6, "end_ms": 2360.9, "model": null, "outcome": "1 search", "detail": {"query": "sinusoidal positional encoding formula absolute position relative ordering property How are the positional encodings built, and why sinusoids rather than learned embeddings?", "papers": ["attention"], "k": 3, "evidence": {"best": 0.719, "union": 0.719, "top_bm25": 56.081, "query_terms": 7}}}, {"name": "decide", "start_ms": 2360.9, "end_ms": 2361.0, "model": null, "outcome": "draft", "detail": {"best": 0.719, "union": 0.719, "top_bm25": 56.081, "query_terms": 7}}, {"name": "draft", "start_ms": 2361.0, "end_ms": 8401.2, "model": null, "outcome": "error:_Step", "detail": {"level": "full"}}, {"name": "wait:draft", "start_ms": 2361.0, "end_ms": 2361.1, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:draft", "start_ms": 2361.1, "end_ms": 5401.2, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "429:rate_limited", "detail": {}}, {"name": "wait:draft", "start_ms": 5401.2, "end_ms": 5401.2, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:draft", "start_ms": 5401.2, "end_ms": 8401.2, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "429:rate_limited", "detail": {}}, {"name": "send", "start_ms": 8403.1, "end_ms": 8403.1, "model": null, "outcome": "passages", "detail": {}}], "checks": {"router": {"papers": ["attention"], "query": "sinusoidal positional encoding formula absolute position relative ordering property How are the positional encodings built, and why sinusoids rather than learned embeddings?", "alt_query": "learned position embeddings addition input position information How are the positional encodings built, and why sinusoids rather than learned embeddings?"}, "retrieval": {"query": "sinusoidal positional encoding formula absolute position relative ordering property How are the positional encodings built, and why sinusoids rather than learned embeddings?", "papers": ["attention"], "k": 3, "pids": ["attention:2400:0011", "attention:2400:0020", "attention:2400:0018"]}}, "released_ms": 8403.1, "budget_wait_ms": 0.1, "tokens_in": 239, "tokens_out": 56, "level_name": "passages", "pipeline_model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 200, "outcome": "ok", "prompt_tokens": 239, "completion_tokens": 56, "tokens_estimated": false, "ms": 334.08910000434844, "waited_s": 0.0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0, "tokens_estimated": true, "ms": 1.112400001147762, "waited_s": 0.0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0, "tokens_estimated": true, "ms": 1.0175999996135943, "waited_s": 0.0}]}}
{"type": "answer", "run_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z", "scenario": "overload_naive_retry", "source": "stand-in", "setting": "large", "setting_def": {"piece_chars": 2400, "k": 3, "rerank": false, "router": true}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "qid": "Q10", "request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0006", "start_time": "2026-11-10T18:32:03.948+00:00", "arrival_offset_s": 22.626, "patience_s": 15.68, "gave_up": false, "waited_ms": 9017.8, "degraded": true, "reply": {"request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0006", "question": "What is Inner Monologue, and how does it give streaming ASR and TTS?", "kind": "passages", "level": 3, "text": "No written answer this time: here are the most relevant passages from the papers, quoted as they are. A written answer should be possible in about 1 s.\n[S1] 2410.00037v1 p.31 §5.7: \"Metrics. Section 3.4.4 and Appendix C describe how Inner Monologue can provide a streaming TTS or streaming ASR system by simply changing the delay it uses between text and audio tokens. In particular, we train a streaming TTS model by delaying audio tokens by 2 seconds, giving some lookahead to the text tokens, and teacher forcing text tokens at inference. Similarly, we train a streaming ASR model by delaying text tokens by 2 seconds, allowing the model to listen to audio content before generating text tokens. In that case, at inference we teacher force the audio tokens.\"\n[S2] 2410.00037v1 pp.41-42 §7: \"To summarize, we introduce a complete suite of models and recipes, from text LLMs to neural audio codecs and generative audio models, which we combine into a real-time spoken dialogue system with a 160ms theoretical latency able to follow complex multi-turn conversations across 5 minutes. We release both Mimi and Moshi to foster the development of such applications. Additionally, we show how our Inner Monologue method allows designing streaming TTS and streaming ASR just by changing the delay between text and audio tokens.\"", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "cite": "2410.00037v1 p.31 §5.7", "pid": "moshi:2400:0050", "paper": "moshi", "block_ids": ["moshi-p31-b003", "moshi-p31-b004", "moshi-p31-b005"]}, {"sid": "S2", "cite": "2410.00037v1 pp.41-42 §7", "pid": "moshi:2400:0065", "paper": "moshi", "block_ids": ["moshi-p41-b005", "moshi-p41-b006", "moshi-p41-b007", "moshi-p41-b008", "moshi-p42-b001"]}], "notice": "passages only, no model call: no drafter available (openai/gpt-oss-120b: 429 rate_limited)", "eta_s": 0.0, "model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}], "spans": [{"name": "plan", "start_ms": 0.0, "end_ms": 0.5, "model": null, "outcome": "full", "detail": {"predicted_wait_s": {"full": {"openai/gpt-oss-120b": 0.0}}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}}, {"name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 3002.0, "model": null, "outcome": "heuristic (qwen/qwen3.8-27b: 429 rate_limited)", "detail": {}}, {"name": "wait:understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 0.5, "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 3002.0, "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "outcome": "429:rate_limited", "detail": {}}, {"name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 3002.0, "end_ms": 3002.4, "model": null, "outcome": "1 search", "detail": {"query": "What is Inner Monologue, and how does it give streaming ASR and TTS?", "papers": null, "k": 3, "evidence": {"best": 1.0, "union": 1.0, "top_bm25": 16.835, "query_terms": 6}}}, {"name": "decide", "start_ms": 3002.4, "end_ms": 3002.5, "model": null, "outcome": "draft", "detail": {"best": 1.0, "union": 1.0, "top_bm25": 16.835, "query_terms": 6}}, {"name": "draft", "start_ms": 3002.5, "end_ms": 9014.9, "model": null, "outcome": "error:_Step", "detail": {"level": "full"}}, {"name": "wait:draft", "start_ms": 3002.5, "end_ms": 3002.6, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:draft", "start_ms": 3002.6, "end_ms": 6001.5, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "429:rate_limited", "detail": {}}, {"name": "wait:draft", "start_ms": 6001.5, "end_ms": 6001.5, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:draft", "start_ms": 6001.5, "end_ms": 9014.8, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "429:rate_limited", "detail": {}}, {"name": "send", "start_ms": 9017.6,