oretical practical end-to-end streaming multimodal What theoretical and practical latency does the paper report?", "papers": ["moshi"], "k": 3, "pids": ["moshi:2400:0040", "moshi:2400:0000", "moshi:2400:0041"]}}, "released_ms": 6417.8, "budget_wait_ms": 0.0, "tokens_in": 233, "tokens_out": 51, "level_name": "passages", "pipeline_model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 200, "outcome": "ok", "prompt_tokens": 233, "completion_tokens": 51, "tokens_estimated": false, "ms": 373.9943999971729, "waited_s": 0.0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0, "tokens_estimated": true, "ms": 1.0496999966562726, "waited_s": 0.0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0, "tokens_estimated": true, "ms": 1.1508000025060028, "waited_s": 0.0}]}}
{"type": "answer", "run_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z", "scenario": "overload_naive_retry", "source": "stand-in", "setting": "large", "setting_def": {"piece_chars": 2400, "k": 3, "rerank": false, "router": true}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "qid": "Q1", "request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0027", "start_time": "2026-11-10T18:33:34.874+00:00", "arrival_offset_s": 113.536, "patience_s": 7.04, "gave_up": false, "waited_ms": 6483.1, "degraded": true, "reply": {"request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0027", "question": "In simple terms, what does scaled dot-product attention compute, and why divide the query-key dot products by sqrt(d_k)?", "kind": "passages", "level": 3, "text": "No written answer this time: here are the most relevant passages from the papers, quoted as they are. A written answer should be possible in about 1 s.\n[S1] 1706.03762v7 p.4 §3.2.1: \"We call our particular attention \"Scaled Dot-Product Attention\" (Figure 2). The input consists of queries and keys of dimension d_k, and values of dimension d_v. We compute the dot products of the query with all keys, divide each by √ d_k, and apply a softmax function to obtain the weights on the values. In practice, we compute the attention function on a set of queries simultaneously, packed together into a matrix Q. The keys and values are also packed together into matrices K and V .\"\n[S2] 1706.03762v7 pp.3-4 §3.2: \"An attention function can be described as mapping a query and a set of key-value pairs to an output, where the query, keys, values, and output are all vectors. The output is computed as a weighted sum Scaled Dot-Product Attention Multi-Head Attention Figure 2: (left) Scaled Dot-Product Attention. (right) Multi-Head Attention consists of several attention layers running in parallel. of the values, where the weight assigned to each value is computed by a compatibility function of the query with the corresponding key.\"", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "cite": "1706.03762v7 p.4 §3.2.1", "pid": "attention:2400:0006", "paper": "attention", "block_ids": ["attention-p04-b005", "attention-p04-b006", "attention-p04-b007", "attention-p04-b008", "attention-p04-b009", "attention-p04-b010", "attention-p04-b011", "attention-p04-b012", "attention-p04-b013"]}, {"sid": "S2", "cite": "1706.03762v7 pp.3-4 §3.2", "pid": "attention:2400:0005", "paper": "attention", "block_ids": ["attention-p03-b007", "attention-p04-b001", "attention-p04-b002", "attention-p04-b003"]}], "notice": "passages only, no model call: no drafter available (openai/gpt-oss-120b: 429 rate_limited)", "eta_s": 0.0, "model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 200, "outcome": "ok", "prompt_tokens": 246, "completion_tokens": 69}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}], "spans": [{"name": "plan", "start_ms": 0.0, "end_ms": 0.7, "model": null, "outcome": "full", "detail": {"predicted_wait_s": {"full