{"type": "answer", "run_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z", "scenario": "overload_naive_retry", "source": "stand-in", "setting": "large", "setting_def": {"piece_chars": 2400, "k": 3, "rerank": false, "router": true}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "qid": "Q12", "request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0033", "start_time": "2026-11-10T18:33:52.303+00:00", "arrival_offset_s": 130.963, "patience_s": 14.12, "gave_up": false, "waited_ms": 6284.9, "degraded": true, "reply": {"request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0033", "question": "What is Moshi's word error rate on noisy Indian English telephone calls?", "kind": "passages", "level": 3, "text": "No written answer this time: here are the most relevant passages from the papers, quoted as they are. A written answer should be possible in about 1 s.\n[S1] 2410.00037v1 p.31 §5.7: \"In particular, we train a streaming TTS model by delaying audio tokens by 2 seconds, giving some lookahead to the text tokens, and teacher forcing text tokens at inference. Similarly, we train a streaming ASR model by delaying text tokens by 2 seconds, allowing the model to listen to audio content before generating text tokens. In that case, at inference we teacher force the audio tokens. We perform TTS with a temperature of 0.6 while we use greedy decoding for ASR, and evaluate on LibriSpeech (Panayotov et al., 2015) test-clean in Word Error Rate (WER).\"\n[S2] 2410.00037v1 p.23 §5.2: \"Metrics. We then evaluate the semantic and acoustic performance of our neural codec, Mimi. First, we evaluate whether the semantic tokens it produces provide targets that are amenable to language modeling. To do so, we compute a triphone-based ABX (Schatz et al., 2013) error rate that characterizes the phonetic discriminability of a representation space by comparing distances between two embeddings of different instances of a same triphone (e.g.“beg”) and a negative triphone that differs minimally (e.g.“bag”).\"", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "cite": "2410.00037v1 p.31 §5.7", "pid": "moshi:2400:0050", "paper": "moshi", "block_ids": ["moshi-p31-b003", "moshi-p31-b004", "moshi-p31-b005"]}, {"sid": "S2", "cite": "2410.00037v1 p.23 §5.2", "pid": "moshi:2400:0036", "paper": "moshi", "block_ids": ["moshi-p23-b004", "moshi-p23-b005", "moshi-p23-b006"]}], "notice": "passages only, no model call: no drafter available (openai/gpt-oss-120b: 429 rate_limited)", "eta_s": 0.0, "model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 200, "outcome": "ok", "prompt_tokens": 235, "completion_tokens": 47}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}], "spans": [{"name": "plan", "start_ms": 0.0, "end_ms": 0.7, "model": null, "outcome": "full", "detail": {"predicted_wait_s": {"full": {"openai/gpt-oss-120b": 0.0}}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}}, {"name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.7, "end_ms": 249.8, "model": null, "outcome": "router", "detail": {}}, {"name": "wait:understand", "start_ms": 0.7, "end_ms": 0.7, "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:understand", "start_ms": 0.7, "end_ms": 249.8, "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "outcome": "200:ok", "detail": {}}, {"name": "retrieve", "start_ms": 249.8, "end_ms": 251.0, "model": null, "outcome": "2 searches", "detail": {"query": "word error rate noisy telephone speech robustness evaluation What is Moshi's word error rate on noisy Indian English telephone calls?", "papers": ["moshi"], "k": 3, "evidence": {"best": 0.5, "union": 0.5, "top_bm25": 17.868, "query_terms": 10}}}, {"name": "retrieve:again", "start_ms": 250.3, "end_ms": 251.0, "model": null, "outcome": "", "detail": {"query": "WER degradation channel noise acoustic performance metrics What is Moshi's word error rate on noisy Indian English telephone calls?", "evidence": {"best": 0.5, "union": 0.805, "top_bm25": 17.868, "query_terms": 10}}}, {"name": "decide", "start_ms": 251.0, "end_ms": 251.1, "model": null, "outcome": "draft", "detail": {"best": 0.5, "union": 0.805, "top_bm25": 17.868, "query_terms": 10}}, {"name": "draft", "start_ms": 251.1, "end_ms": 6281.1, "model": null, "outcome": "error:_Step", "detail": {"level": "full"}}, {"name": "wait:draft", "start_ms": 251.1, "end_ms": 251.1, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:draft", "start_ms": 251.1, "end_ms": 3279.9, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "429:rate_limited", "detail": {}}, {"name": "wait:draft", "start_ms": 3280.0, "end_ms": 3280.0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "granted", "detail": {"waited_s": 0.0}}, {"name": "call:draft", "start_ms": 3280.0, "end_ms": 6281.0, "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "outcome": "429:rate_limited", "detail": {}}, {"name": "send", "start_ms": 6284.6, "end_ms": 6284.6, "model": null, "outcome": "passages", "detail": {}}], "checks": {"router": {"papers": ["moshi"], "query": "word error rate noisy telephone speech robustness evaluation What is Moshi's word error rate on noisy Indian English telephone calls?", "alt_query": "WER degradation channel noise acoustic performance metrics What is Moshi's word error rate on noisy Indian English telephone calls?"}, "retrieval": {"query": "word error rate noisy telephone speech robustness evaluation What is Moshi's word error rate on noisy Indian English telephone calls?", "papers": ["moshi"], "k": 3, "pids": ["moshi:2400:0050", "moshi:2400:0036", "moshi:2400:0027"]}}, "released_ms": 6284.6, "budget_wait_ms": 0.0, "tokens_in": 235, "tokens_out": 47, "level_name": "passages", "pipeline_model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 200, "outcome": "ok", "prompt_tokens": 235, "completion_tokens": 47, "tokens_estimated": false, "ms": 248.9787000013166, "waited_s": 0.0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0, "tokens_estimated": true, "ms": 1.090700003260281, "waited_s": 0.0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0, "tokens_estimated": true, "ms": 1.167800000985153, "waited_s": 0.0}]}}
{"type": "answer", "run_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z", "scenario": "overload_naive_retry", "source": "stand-in", "setting": "large", "setting_def": {"piece_chars": 2400, "k": 3, "rerank": false, "router": true}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "qid": "Q14", "request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0032", "start_time": "2026-11-10T18:33:52.260+00:00", "arrival_offset_s": 130.916, "patience_s": 13.56, "gave_up": false, "waited_ms": 6397.7, "degraded": true, "reply": {"request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0032", "question": "How does H-Net decide where to cut the byte stream into pieces?", "kind": "passages", "level": 3, "text": "No written answer this time: here are the most relevant passages from the papers, quoted as they are. A written answer should be possible in about 1 s.\n[S1] 2507.07955v2 pp.2-4 §1: \"(top-right) Key components of a dechunking layer: (c) a smoothing module for converting discrete chunks into interpolated representations, and (d) an upsampler that restores compressed vectors to their original resolution based on boundary indicators. Linear in equation (3) and STE in equation (9) are omitted in the illustration for brevity. language model: with a single stage of dynamic chunking, a byte-level H-Net matches the perplexity and downstream performance of a strong BPE-tokenized Transformer at sizes exceeding 1B parameters.\"\n[S2] 2507.07955v2 p.2 §1: \"2023) exhibit training instabilities that preclude scaling beyond small models or nesting multi-level hierarchies. Fundamentally, creating a tokenizer-free architecture requires incorporating the data chunking process directly into the model, while overcoming challenges in efficiency, learnability, and stability at scale. Dynamic Chunking: End-to-end Sequence Modeling Without Tokenization In this work, we introduce an end-to-end hierarchical network (H-Net) that compresses raw data through a recursive, data-dependent dynamic chunking (DC) process (Figure 1).\"", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "cite": "2507.07955v2 pp.2-4 §1", "pid": "dynamic_chunking:2400:0004", "paper": "dynamic_chunking", "block_ids": ["dynamic_chunking-p02-b011", "dynamic_chunking-p02-b012", "dynamic_chunking-p03-b001", "dynamic_chunking-p03-b002", "dynamic_chunking-p04-b001", "dynamic_chunking-p04-b002"]}, {"sid": "S2", "cite": "2507.07955v2 p.2 §1", "pid": "dynamic_chunking:2400:0002", "paper": "dynamic_chunking", "block_ids": ["dynamic_chunking-p02-b002", "dynamic_chunking-p02-b003", "dynamic_chunking-p02-b004", "dynamic_chunking-p02-b005", "dynamic_chunking-p02-b006", "dynamic_chunking-p02-b007"]}], "notice": "passages only, no model call: no drafter available (openai/gpt-oss-120b: 429 rate_limited)", "eta_s": 0.0, "model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 200, "outcome": "ok", "prompt_tokens": 233, "completion_tokens": 60}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}], "spans": [{"na