{"type": "answer", "run_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z", "scenario": "overload_naive_retry", "source": "stand-in", "setting": "large", "setting_def": {"piece_chars": 2400, "k": 3, "rerank": false, "router": true}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "qid": "Q10", "request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0036", "start_time": "2026-11-10T18:33:56.157+00:00", "arrival_offset_s": 134.839, "patience_s": 13.7, "gave_up": false, "waited_ms": 6353.9, "degraded": true, "reply": {"request_id": "overload_naive_retry-20261110T183141Z-0036", "question": "What is Inner Monologue, and how does it give streaming ASR and TTS?", "kind": "passages", "level": 3, "text": "No written answer this time: here are the most relevant passages from the papers, quoted as they are. A written answer should be possible in about 1 s.\n[S1] 2410.00037v1 p.31 §5.7: \"Metrics. Section 3.4.4 and Appendix C describe how Inner Monologue can provide a streaming TTS or streaming ASR system by simply changing the delay it uses between text and audio tokens. In particular, we train a streaming TTS model by delaying audio tokens by 2 seconds, giving some lookahead to the text tokens, and teacher forcing text tokens at inference. Similarly, we train a streaming ASR model by delaying text tokens by 2 seconds, allowing the model to listen to audio content before generating text tokens. In that case, at inference we teacher force the audio tokens.\"\n[S2] 2410.00037v1 pp.41-42 §7: \"To summarize, we introduce a complete suite of models and recipes, from text LLMs to neural audio codecs and generative audio models, which we combine into a real-time spoken dialogue system with a 160ms theoretical latency able to follow complex multi-turn conversations across 5 minutes. We release both Mimi and Moshi to foster the development of such applications. Additionally, we show how our Inner Monologue method allows designing streaming TTS and streaming ASR just by changing the delay between text and audio tokens.\"", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "cite": "2410.00037v1 p.31 §5.7", "pid": "moshi:2400:0050", "paper": "moshi", "block_ids": ["moshi-p31-b003", "moshi-p31-b004", "moshi-p31-b005"]}, {"sid": "S2", "cite": "2410.00037v1 pp.41-42 §7", "pid": "moshi:2400:0065", "paper": "moshi", "block_ids": ["moshi-p41-b005", "moshi-p41-b006", "moshi-p41-b007", "moshi-p41-b008", "moshi-p42-b001"]}], "notice": "passages only, no model call: no drafter available (openai/gpt-oss-120b: 429 rate_limited)", "eta_s": 0.0, "model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 200, "outcome": "ok", "prompt_tokens": 234, "completion_tokens": 54}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}], "spans": [{"name": "plan", "start_ms": 0.0, "end_ms": 0.3, "model": null, "outcome": "full", "detail": {"predicted_wait_s": {"full": {"openai/gpt-oss-120b": 0.0}}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}}, {"name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.3, "end_ms